cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "cc4adapt: Carbon Credits for Adaptation (CC4A) practice register and adaptation-factor analysis"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Alliance of Bioversity International and CIAT"
    city: Rome
    country: IT
  - family-names: Steward
    given-names: Peter
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3985-4911"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CC4A-SSA/cc4adapt"
license: MIT
version: "0.1-prototype"
date-released: "2026-04-20"
abstract: >-
  Practice register for agricultural carbon-credit practices with
  adaptation co-benefits, and an exploratory comparison of avoided-loss
  formulations on Africa Agriculture Adaptation Atlas hazard data. The
  April 2026 prototype pipeline is archived in CC4A-SSA/cc4adapt-pipeline-v0. Data and outputs are CC BY 4.0; code is MIT.
  Layers that incorporate TNC/Naturebase inputs follow the consortium
  data-sharing agreement.
keywords:
  - carbon credits
  - climate adaptation
  - sub-Saharan Africa
  - hazard exposure
  - MapSPAM
